Error: Jet.FlattenNonStruct: `#Codable(.Flatten)` on `count` needs a struct-typed field
  --> Tests/UI/serde_flatten_not_struct.jet:5:24
    |
  5 |     #Codable(.Flatten) count: Int,
    |                        ^^^^^
 Why: Flatten splices another struct's keys into this object, so the field must be a `#[Codable]` struct — not a primitive, list, or map
 Fix: Give `count` a `#[Codable]` struct type, or drop `#Codable(.Flatten)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.FlattenNonStruct
